OL,3,GNEWSAWind gust of 84mph recorded as
OL,4,AStorm Boelo brings disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of homes were left without
OL,7,Fpower on Sunday morning after
OL,8,Fback-to-back storms led to flooding and
OL,9,Fand felled trees in Wales.
OL,11,FA wind gust of 84mph (135km/h) was
OL,12,Frecorded in Capel Curig, Conwy county,
OL,13,Fon Saturday, which also saw 2.1in
OL,14,F(54.6mm) of rain.
OL,16,FPolice forces and councils said they
OL,17,Fhave been dealing with flooding and
OL,18,Ftrees down as Storm Boelo followed
OL,19,FStorm Austen over the weekend.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
